        "type": "thinking",
        "thinking": "I'm trying to recall the exact dhatu \"निवास\" with the meaning आच्छादने, checking whether it belongs to चुरादिगण, and cross-referencing how the Siddhanta Kaumudi lists it among similar roots like \"वस्\".\n\nConfirming निवास is indeed in the अदन्त list with final अ. So the णिच् form would be निवास + णिच् → अतो लोपः → निवासि. Since this is a चुरादि णिजन्त verb, it takes उभयपद. In parasmaipada, the आशीर्लिङ् form becomes निवास्यासम् (with णेरनिटि deleting णि before यासुट्), while आत्मनेपद gives निवासयिषीय.\n\n",
